    {
     "t": "event-field",
     "field": "title",
     "text": "Bertha is Back!! Pop-Up",
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "t": "event-field",
     "field": "datetime",
     "text": "June 14, 2024\n@ 3:00 pm\n- 7:00 pm"
    },
    {
     "t": "image",
     "ref": "assets/source/6dbdd385-Garcia_Hand_Picked_logo_200px.png",
     "srcUrl": "https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Garcia_Hand_Picked_logo_200px.png?lossy=2&strip=0&webp=1",
     "alt": "Garcia Hand Picked",
     "w": 200,
     "h": 193,
     "kind": "event-image"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><img src=\"assets/source/899e524e-GHP_Lifestyle_Bertha_1-1024x678.png\" alt=\"Bertha is Back!! Pop-Up\" width=\"781\" height=\"517\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/GHP_Lifestyle_Bertha_1-1024x678.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/4e618ae1-GHP_Lifestyle_Bertha_1.png\"></p><p><strong>Bertha is back!!! Experience their music, games, chance to chill, free giveaways, and merchandise for sale. Holistic Industries will have brand ambassadors available to educate you on Garcia Hand Picked products too!</strong></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "THEIR STORY"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Given a blank space to create a cannabis brand worthy of Jerry, we picked everything carefully. We took an eco-friendly path whenever possible, sourced original and unique genetics with stories of their own, and partnered with expert and honorable people to cultivate, roll joints, and make sure everything is of the highest quality. We spent a lot of time looking for the right partners to ensure our weed is worth sharing. Our traveling Airstream, Bertha, continues to crisscross the country spreading her magic and bliss. She’s filled with merch and music and has become a beloved ambassador of Garcia Hand Picked.</p><p>Set intention for a good time, pick a favorite show, and share with your tribe what thousands of fans have already discovered: the transcendent experience of cannabis and music. Expand your mind and remember that life is yours to explore and enjoy.</p><p>Jerry was a musician, an artist, a legend, and for sure, someone who opted for fun in his lifetime. That is our hope for you. Take a moment to reconnect with everything that is beautiful, right, and good, and above all else, don’t forget to have fun!</p><p>With gratitude from our family to yours,<br> The Garcia Family</p><p><a href=\"/brands/garcia-hand-picked/\"><img src=\"assets/source/5fdc3aff-Garcia-Bundle-2024-757x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Garcia Hand Picked Exclusive Bundle on June 14, 2024\" width=\"591\" height=\"800\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Garcia-Bundle-2024-757x1024.jpg?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/4ddcf74e-Garcia-Bundle-2024.jpg\"></a></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "CLASSIC FLOWER"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Inspired by old-school lot strains, Garcia Hand Picked cultivars like Florida Kush and LA Baker are becoming big hits with cannabis lovers.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "JERRY’S PICKS"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Modeled after Jerry’s guitar picks, Jerry’s Picks are tasty, all-natural, and terpene infused for a natural effect. With blueberry, raspberry, blackberry and 10 mg of THC artfully blended together, fun is highly likely.</p>",
     "overflow": true
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "DOUBLE DOOBIE"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Imagine two joints where you thought there might be one, introducing Double Doobie. Same cultivars you’ve come to love, now in a two-half gram joint package. More joints, more bridges.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "ROADIE PACK"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Ten packs of quality pre-rolled joints are now available in eco-friendly packs made for passing and sharing.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Click here to shop Garcia Hand Picked products!",
     "href": "/brands/garcia-hand-picked/"
    },
